A||||29||AkursedX||ACCEL  ignition coils suck!!||||1||
Z||000000||AkursedX||07-04-2001||12:35 AM||||Well, I am FINALLY back home after my ignition coil dies on me and left me stranded  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  I'm just glad I still had my old coil to replace it with, and now it is running even better than it was!<P>So, to anyone looking for a hi-po coil, I would go with the MSD coil over the accel.  I have heard too many bad stories about them, and now I have my own to add to it.<P>By the way, the coil was only on for 5 months.    <P>But, I am thankful that it merely was a coil problem and nothing else!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
