Z||000016||chester||07-04-2001||08:27 PM||||I've had the Accel Electronic Supercoil on my GT for 1.5 years now without any probs.  Getting ready to install an MSD 6AL to go with it. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ||||reg||1
